==Format==
* '''16 Team Swiss System:''' ''June 3<sup>rd</sup> – 6<sup>th</sup>, 2025''
** Rounds 2 to 5 are seeded using the {{Abbr|Buchholz system|Ranking based on opponents' performance}} & teams' initial seeds
** Elimination and Advancement matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** All other matches are {{Abbr/Bo1}}
* Top 8 Teams proceed to '''[[BLAST/Major/2025/Austin/Stage 2|Stage 2]]'''
* Bottom 8 Teams are eliminated
* {{Swiss Explained|width=790px|margin=45px|seeding=** The initial match-ups are seeded using teams' ranking on the Valve Global Standings.}}

